# About the Company

Padmamba Technologies is an Indian home appliances brand established in 1998, offering a wide range of affordable and reliable consumer products.

The product portfolio includes televisions, air coolers, ceiling fans, LED lighting, flashlights, mixer grinders, wet grinders, electric irons, gas stoves, and other home appliances.

The brand focuses on delivering premium-quality products at affordable prices while supporting the Made in India initiative.

---

# My Mission

When I first looked at the company's online presence, I realized that the website did not reflect the actual quality of the brand.

The existing website was built using a generic template with limited customization, weak product presentation, poor user experience, and minimal SEO optimization.

I decided to rebuild the company's digital presence from scratch to create a modern experience that communicates trust, quality, and professionalism.

